{"4150140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "命运挽歌：词汇英灵录", "steam_appid": 4150140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Vocabulary running low? Tired of boring word drills?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to summon your inner hero—because this <strong>English vocabulary RPG</strong> is here to save the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight monsters, level up, and expand your vocabulary effortlessly through thrilling adventures.<br>Who knew learning English could be this addictive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/5205d8b7a20f035a5cc5c9086d1bf639.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1220 height=680 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elegy of Fate: Lexical Heroes</strong> is a unique <strong>RPG designed to expand your English vocabulary</strong> through gameplay.<br>If you’ve ever felt lost about how to improve your word power—or simply bored by endless flashcards—this game offers a fresh, immersive solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When <strong>English learning transforms into a fantasy adventure</strong>, every word becomes the <strong>key to awakening powerful Spirits</strong>.<br><i>Elegy of Fate: Lexical Heroes</i> breaks the boundary between <strong>education and entertainment</strong>, leading you on a journey where <strong>knowledge and courage coexist</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, memorizing words is no longer a burden—it’s the <strong>core power</strong> that drives your hero forward.<br>Master words, cast spells, and unlock a new level of language fluency while fully immersed in the magic of battle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 World Setting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/849456b40e01e0ed76d94a5e007c8749.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1220 height=680 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story continues within the world of <strong>Yusiaid</strong>, from the previous title <strong><i>Chaos Entropy</i></strong><i> (formerly </i><strong>Elegy of Fate</strong><i>: Light and Shadow)</i>.<br>You play as a <strong>novice entering Lunrant Magic Academy</strong>, the continent’s most prestigious school for mages.<br>New students must learn how to wield <strong>Spirit Cards</strong> to summon legendary heroes known as <strong>Spirits</strong>.<br>To control them in combat, you must accumulate <strong>magic incantations—English words</strong>—and become a true <strong>Spirit Summoner</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/1c9efa84370876a9138c31a6f11b2f0f.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1224 height=690 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/c61634a5983e7d5c24d19a7812e89ce2.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/9740bc244dfe54a069ac2cf55454b1da.avif?t=1780906069\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras_big/9740bc244dfe54a069ac2cf55454b1da.avif?t=1780906069 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖 Vocabulary Battle System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles are no longer just about numbers.<br>When facing monsters, words appear on the screen—you must quickly choose the correct meaning from several options.<br>Each correct answer restores your Spirit’s <strong>mana</strong>, enabling you to cast powerful spells.<br>Choose incorrectly, and your <strong>chanting time</strong> will decrease; once it reaches zero, the spell backfires and damages your Spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, when fighting a <strong>Flame Demon</strong>, the word <i>ignite</i> appears.<br>If you correctly select “to set on fire,” your Spirit instantly regains mana and can unleash a devastating fire spell.<br>This tight fusion of <strong>language learning and combat</strong> keeps every battle exciting—turning vocabulary practice into a thrilling, skill-based challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧭 Spirit Collection &amp; Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/0e08e3befa2e03329eb9d9e10f2a2d1e.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1222 height=684 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/b78aca4740fbab0a52088b9a60a181e5.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1224 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through exploration across Yusiaid, you can encounter and summon <strong>serveral unique Spirits</strong>, each with distinct personalities, abilities, and stories. <br>Use <strong>Spirit Summon Cards</strong> to recruit them, strengthen their skills, and create powerful team combinations.<br>Your mastery of vocabulary—combined with smart strategy—determines victory on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/894d5d308388f93916e991cb1272b0c1.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1220 height=678 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏰 A Journey of Knowledge and Courage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>Elegy of Fate: Lexical Heroes</strong>, where every word carries power, and every battle sharpens your mind.<br>Learn, fight, and grow as you journey through this magical realm—<br>because in this world, <strong>words are the strongest spells of all</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for?<br>Embark on your adventure today, and <strong>rewrite your destiny with knowledge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/3b28e1a5bf8afefbed8affbad6ee3cf7.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1226 height=684 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/f09015051a7376097ccfe506830d07a9.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1226 height=686 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Vocabulary running low? Tired of boring word drills?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to summon your inner hero—because this <strong>English vocabulary RPG</strong> is here to save the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight monsters, level up, and expand your vocabulary effortlessly through thrilling adventures.<br>Who knew learning English could be this addictive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/5205d8b7a20f035a5cc5c9086d1bf639.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1220 height=680 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elegy of Fate: Lexical Heroes</strong> is a unique <strong>RPG designed to expand your English vocabulary</strong> through gameplay.<br>If you’ve ever felt lost about how to improve your word power—or simply bored by endless flashcards—this game offers a fresh, immersive solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When <strong>English learning transforms into a fantasy adventure</strong>, every word becomes the <strong>key to awakening powerful Spirits</strong>.<br><i>Elegy of Fate: Lexical Heroes</i> breaks the boundary between <strong>education and entertainment</strong>, leading you on a journey where <strong>knowledge and courage coexist</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, memorizing words is no longer a burden—it’s the <strong>core power</strong> that drives your hero forward.<br>Master words, cast spells, and unlock a new level of language fluency while fully immersed in the magic of battle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 World Setting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/849456b40e01e0ed76d94a5e007c8749.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1220 height=680 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story continues within the world of <strong>Yusiaid</strong>, from the previous title <strong><i>Chaos Entropy</i></strong><i> (formerly </i><strong>Elegy of Fate</strong><i>: Light and Shadow)</i>.<br>You play as a <strong>novice entering Lunrant Magic Academy</strong>, the continent’s most prestigious school for mages.<br>New students must learn how to wield <strong>Spirit Cards</strong> to summon legendary heroes known as <strong>Spirits</strong>.<br>To control them in combat, you must accumulate <strong>magic incantations—English words</strong>—and become a true <strong>Spirit Summoner</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/1c9efa84370876a9138c31a6f11b2f0f.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1224 height=690 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/c61634a5983e7d5c24d19a7812e89ce2.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/9740bc244dfe54a069ac2cf55454b1da.avif?t=1780906069\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras_big/9740bc244dfe54a069ac2cf55454b1da.avif?t=1780906069 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖 Vocabulary Battle System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles are no longer just about numbers.<br>When facing monsters, words appear on the screen—you must quickly choose the correct meaning from several options.<br>Each correct answer restores your Spirit’s <strong>mana</strong>, enabling you to cast powerful spells.<br>Choose incorrectly, and your <strong>chanting time</strong> will decrease; once it reaches zero, the spell backfires and damages your Spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, when fighting a <strong>Flame Demon</strong>, the word <i>ignite</i> appears.<br>If you correctly select “to set on fire,” your Spirit instantly regains mana and can unleash a devastating fire spell.<br>This tight fusion of <strong>language learning and combat</strong> keeps every battle exciting—turning vocabulary practice into a thrilling, skill-based challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧭 Spirit Collection &amp; Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/0e08e3befa2e03329eb9d9e10f2a2d1e.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1222 height=684 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/b78aca4740fbab0a52088b9a60a181e5.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1224 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through exploration across Yusiaid, you can encounter and summon <strong>serveral unique Spirits</strong>, each with distinct personalities, abilities, and stories. <br>Use <strong>Spirit Summon Cards</strong> to recruit them, strengthen their skills, and create powerful team combinations.<br>Your mastery of vocabulary—combined with smart strategy—determines victory on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/894d5d308388f93916e991cb1272b0c1.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1220 height=678 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏰 A Journey of Knowledge and Courage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>Elegy of Fate: Lexical Heroes</strong>, where every word carries power, and every battle sharpens your mind.<br>Learn, fight, and grow as you journey through this magical realm—<br>because in this world, <strong>words are the strongest spells of all</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for?<br>Embark on your adventure today, and <strong>rewrite your destiny with knowledge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/3b28e1a5bf8afefbed8affbad6ee3cf7.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1226 height=684 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/extras/f09015051a7376097ccfe506830d07a9.avif?t=1780906069\" width=1226 height=686 /></span></p>", "short_description": "You are a new student at Lunrant Magic Academy, the top magic school on the continent of Yusiaid. Here, you’ll learn to control Spirit Cards and summon mighty Spirits. By mastering magic spells (English words), you’ll guide your Spirits in battle and grow into a powerful Spirit Summoner.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150140/5cf66c8fc828dd8f7ea6204d8bd41ad8b6e364f3/header.jpg?t=1780906069", "capsule_image": "htt